{"strongs": "H4385", "word": "מִכְתָּב", "translit": "mikh.tav", "root": "כשף", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "writing", "definition": "מִכְתָּב noun masculine 2Chr 21:12 writing ; — absolute ׳ מ Deut 10:4 + 5t.; construct מִכְתַּב Exod 32:16 + 2 t.; — 1. = handwriting וְהַמִּכְתָּב מִכְתַּב אֱלֹהִים הוּא Exod 32:16 . 2. = thing written, Exod 39:30 (accusative of congnate meaning with verb with כָּתַב ), Deut 10:4 specifically a royal enactment or edict (= כְּתָב כתם 4. ), 2Chr 35:4 || כְּתָב , 2Chr 36:22 = Ezra 1:1 a prophetic writing 2Chr 21:12 . 3. in a title, לְחִזְקִיָּהוּ ׳ מ Isa 38:9 Writing of Hezekiah.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4242')\">BDB4242</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4385')\">H4385</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4241')\">BDB4241</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4243')\">BDB4243</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִכְתָּב</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Chr 21:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,12)\">2Chr 21:12</ref></sup> <highlightword>writing</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 10:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,4)\">Deut 10:4</ref> + 5t.; construct <bdbheb>מִכְתַּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,16)\">Exod 32:16</ref> + 2 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> = <highlight>handwriting</highlight> <bdbheb>וְהַמִּכְתָּב מִכְתַּב אֱלֹהִים הוּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,16)\">Exod 32:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = thing written, <ref ref=\"Exod 39:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,30)\">Exod 39:30</ref> (accusative of congnate meaning with verb with <bdbheb>כָּתַב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 10:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,4)\">Deut 10:4</ref> specifically a royal enactment or edict (= <bdbheb>כְּתָב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>כתם</bdbheb> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,4)\">2Chr 35:4</ref> || <bdbheb>כְּתָב</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,22)\">2Chr 36:22</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:1\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,1)\">Ezra 1:1</ref> a prophetic writing <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,12)\">2Chr 21:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in a title, <bdbheb>לְחִזְקִיָּהוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 38:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,9)\">Isa 38:9</ref> <highlight>Writing of Hezekiah.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Chr 21:12", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Deut 10:4", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 10, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Exod 32:16", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 32, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Exod 39:30", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 39, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:4", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "2Chr 36:22", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 36, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezra 1:1", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Isa 38:9", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 38, "verse": 9}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מִכְתָּב", "׳", "מ", "מִכְתַּב", "וְהַמִּכְתָּב מִכְתַּב אֱלֹהִים הוּא", "כָּתַב", "כְּתָב", "כתם", "לְחִזְקִיָּהוּ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB4242", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}